{"seq":1,"slug":"message-passing","title":"消息传递与结构化克隆","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-web-workers-parallelism/messaging/message-passing","wordCount":1043,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"消息传递与结构化克隆\">消息传递与结构化克隆</h1><p>Worker 世界里最容易被低估的一行代码是 <code>worker.postMessage(data)</code>。它看起来只是「把数据发过去」，实际上背后是一整套叫结构化克隆的算法在做深拷贝——而这次拷贝的耗时，常常才是决定并行到底划不划算的隐藏变量。这一篇把消息传递这条唯一的桥讲透。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-postmessage-与结构化克隆\">核心概念：postMessage 与结构化克隆</h2><p>因为两条线程不共享任何变量，主线程 <code>postMessage</code> 出去的对象，Worker 收到的绝不是同一个引用，而是一份<strong>深拷贝</strong>。执行这份拷贝的是浏览器内置的<strong>结构化克隆算法（Structured Clone）</strong>：它递归遍历对象，复制其中的值，并且能正确处理 JSON 处理不了的类型——<code>Date</code>、<code>Map</code>、<code>Set</code>、<code>RegExp</code>、<code>ArrayBuffer</code>、<code>Blob</code>、循环引用，全都能克隆。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[主线程对象 obj] --&gt; B[postMessage obj]&#10;    B --&gt; C[结构化克隆算法&lt;br/&gt;递归深拷贝]&#10;    C --&gt; D{类型可克隆?}&#10;    D --&gt;|Date/Map/Set/ArrayBuffer| E[复制到目标线程]&#10;    D --&gt;|函数/DOM 节点/Error 栈| F[抛 DataCloneError]&#10;    E --&gt; G[Worker 收到全新副本&lt;br/&gt;与原对象无引用关系]\">flowchart TD\n    A[主线程对象 obj] --&gt; B[postMessage obj]\n    B --&gt; C[结构化克隆算法&lt;br/&gt;递归深拷贝]\n    C --&gt; D{类型可克隆?}\n    D --&gt;|Date/Map/Set/ArrayBuffer| E[复制到目标线程]\n    D --&gt;|函数/DOM 节点/Error 栈| F[抛 DataCloneError]\n    E --&gt; G[Worker 收到全新副本&lt;br/&gt;与原对象无引用关系]</pre><p>关键是「无引用关系」：Worker 改它收到的副本，主线程那份纹丝不动。这消除了数据竞争，代价是每次通信都要为拷贝付时间和内存。下表对比结构化克隆与两个近亲。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>能否传函数</th>\n<th>能否传 Date/Map</th>\n<th>处理循环引用</th>\n<th>典型用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>JSON.stringify</code></td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>否（Date 变字符串）</td>\n<td>否，会抛错</td>\n<td>网络序列化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>结构化克隆</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>postMessage / IndexedDB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可转移对象</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>不适用</td>\n<td>不适用</td>\n<td>零拷贝移交 buffer</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"拷贝不了的东西\">拷贝不了的东西</h2><p>结构化克隆有明确的黑名单，踩中会抛 <code>DataCloneError</code>。<strong>函数</strong>不能克隆（闭包无法跨线程重建），<strong>DOM 节点</strong>不能克隆，<strong>Error 对象的栈信息</strong>会丢失，带有不可克隆属性的普通对象也会失败。这解释了一个新手常犯的错：想把带方法的类实例发进 Worker，结果方法全丢了——克隆只复制数据字段，不复制原型链上的方法。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"worker.postMessage({ fn: () =&gt; 1 }); // DataCloneError：函数不可克隆&#10;worker.postMessage(document.body); // DataCloneError：DOM 节点不可克隆&#10;&#10;// 正确做法：只发纯数据，逻辑放在 Worker 内部&#10;worker.postMessage({ cmd: &#39;compute&#39;, payload: { nums: [1, 2, 3] } });\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>worker.postMessage({ fn: () => 1 }); // DataCloneError：函数不可克隆</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>worker.postMessage(document.body); // DataCloneError：DOM 节点不可克隆</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 正确做法：只发纯数据，逻辑放在 Worker 内部</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>worker.postMessage({ cmd: 'compute', payload: { nums: [1, 2, 3] } });</span></span></code></pre></div><p>要在 Worker 里调用「远端方法」，正确抽象是 RPC——把方法名和参数当数据发过去，由 Worker 侧分发。这正是 <a href=\"../patterns/comlink-rpc\">Comlink 与 RPC 抽象</a> 要解决的问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"拷贝的成本与优化\">拷贝的成本与优化</h2><p>结构化克隆的耗时大致与数据的字节数和结构复杂度成正比。设待传数据大小为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span>、克隆吞吐为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 字节每毫秒，则一次通信的拷贝耗时约为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≈</mo><mfrac><mi>S</mi><mi>r</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{clone} \\approx \\frac{S}{r}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>只有当被卸载计算的耗时 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>≫</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C \\gg 2 T_{clone}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≫</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（去一次、回一次）时，卸载才明显划算。这意味着传几十兆的 <code>ArrayBuffer</code> 用结构化克隆是灾难——拷贝本身就要几十毫秒，可能比计算还久。三种优化思路：一是减少传输量，只发计算真正需要的字段；二是对大二进制数据改用零拷贝的转移，见 <a href=\"transferable-objects\">可转移对象</a>；三是对高频读写的共享数据改用 <a href=\"shared-array-buffer\">SharedArrayBuffer 与原子</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"messagechannel-与端口通信\">MessageChannel 与端口通信</h2><p><code>postMessage</code> 之外，浏览器还提供 <code>MessageChannel</code>——它凭空造出一对相连的 <code>MessagePort</code>，<code>port1</code> 发的消息 <code>port2</code> 收得到，反之亦然。这在需要点对点、脱离 <code>worker.onmessage</code> 全局入口的场景很有用，比如给每个任务开一条独立通道，避免消息串扰。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"const channel = new MessageChannel();&#10;// 把 port2 转移给 Worker，之后双方各持一端独立通信&#10;worker.postMessage({ cmd: &#39;setup&#39;, port: channel.port2 }, [channel.port2]);&#10;channel.port1.onmessage = (e) =&gt; console.log(&#39;专属通道回复&#39;, e.data);&#10;channel.port1.postMessage(&#39;hello via channel&#39;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const channel = new MessageChannel();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 把 port2 转移给 Worker，之后双方各持一端独立通信</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>worker.postMessage({ cmd: 'setup', port: channel.port2 }, [channel.port2]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>channel.port1.onmessage = (e) => console.log('专属通道回复', e.data);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>channel.port1.postMessage('hello via channel');</span></span></code></pre></div><p>注意 <code>channel.port2</code> 出现在 <code>postMessage</code> 的第二个参数数组里——端口是可转移对象，必须转移而非克隆。共享 Worker 的每个连接、Comlink 的每个代理，底层都在用 MessagePort。第二个参数这个「转移列表」的完整语义，正是下一篇的主题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Worker 不共享变量，<code>postMessage</code> 靠结构化克隆做深拷贝，收到的是无引用关系的副本。</li>\n<li>结构化克隆能处理 Date/Map/Set/ArrayBuffer 和循环引用，但函数、DOM 节点、类方法拷不了。</li>\n<li>拷贝耗时约正比于数据大小；只有计算耗时远大于两次拷贝时卸载才划算。</li>\n<li>大二进制数据别用克隆，改用转移；高频共享数据改用 SharedArrayBuffer。</li>\n<li>MessageChannel 提供成对 MessagePort，支持点对点通道，是共享 Worker 与 Comlink 的底座。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同章 <a href=\"transferable-objects\">可转移对象</a>：用零拷贝转移消除大数据的克隆成本。</li>\n<li>同章 <a href=\"shared-array-buffer\">SharedArrayBuffer 与原子</a>：连拷贝都省掉的真共享内存。</li>\n<li>跨库 <a href=\"../../browser-and-web-api/browser-internals/event-loop\">浏览器与 Web API · 事件循环</a>：消息如何进入目标线程的任务队列。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"消息传递与结构化克隆","id":"消息传递与结构化克隆"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：postMessage 与结构化克隆","id":"核心概念-postmessage-与结构化克隆"},{"level":2,"text":"拷贝不了的东西","id":"拷贝不了的东西"},{"level":2,"text":"拷贝的成本与优化","id":"拷贝的成本与优化"},{"level":2,"text":"MessageChannel 与端口通信","id":"messagechannel-与端口通信"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"Worker 类型：专用、共享与 Service","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-web-workers-parallelism/foundations/worker-types"},"next":{"title":"可转移对象与零拷贝","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-web-workers-parallelism/messaging/transferable-objects"}}